  "no_later_amendments": "no filterfix entries after line 713 at verification time",
  "decision_rule": "Same as parity:12-table3 (432): per scale s, per seed index i (ours 1/2/3 <-> gsplat 42/43/44), d_i = 9-scene mean PSNR(M-fixed) - PSNR(gsplat-aa). AHEAD iff mean(d) > 2*SD(d) (ddof=1, n=3) AND no scene's 3-seed mean delta < -0.05 dB; BEHIND iff mean(d) < -2*SD; else PARITY. Row: AHEAD iff AHEAD at all 4 scales; BEHIND iff BEHIND at any scale; else PARITY. Drift: |mean(M-rerun - kept M)| > 0.10 dB at a scale makes that scale's primary descriptive. Secondary M-fixed vs M-rerun is same-batch (clean) and cannot change the primary.",
  "class_max": "verdict per parity:12-table3 rule, labelled 'not same-batch for gsplat-aa'"
 },
